X.LP
XOthello is played on an 8 x 8 board, with pieces which are black on one side
Xand white on the other. A legal move consists of placing a piece of one's own
Xcolor on the board so as to "sandwich" a row (orthogonal or diagonal)
Xof pieces of the opposite color between the piece just placed and
Xanother piece of the same color. All pieces so sandwiched are flipped
Xover to reveal the color of the other side.
X.LP
XThe object of the game, is to have more pieces than the opponent at
Xthe end of the game (ie. when the board is full or neither side has
Xa legal move). If you have no legal move, you simply miss a turn.
